{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hello, Marines!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suit up with style\u2014this DLC brings <strong>5 brand-new, exclusive skins</strong> to your arsenal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than just a visual upgrade, this is a <strong>Supporter Pack</strong> designed for those who want to go the extra mile. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your purchase helps us deliver <strong>ongoing updates and new content</strong> across the <strong>Red Solstice universe</strong>\u2014including <i>Red Solstice</i>, <i>Red Solstice 2</i>, and <i>Solstice Chronicles: MIA</i>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By grabbing this pack, you're not just upgrading your look\u2014<strong>you're actively supporting the future of the Red Solstice franchise</strong>. Every purchase directly fuels further development and helps keep the fight alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243340/extras/SkinPackMIA.jpg?t=1750951100\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DLC Content:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Black Ops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grind Hogs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heavy Duty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Erebus Chosen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Founders</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thank you for your support, and we\u2019ll see you on the battlefield.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3243340?t=1750951100","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3243340?t=1750951100","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item